{\pard\fs26\b\sb360\sa160 3. Limits of originality claims\par}{\pard\fs24\sa140\sl276\slmult1 The general idea of resume-to-job matching, weighted arithmetic, text normalization, model fine-tuning, and forecasting is not claimed as exclusive. Third-party libraries, pretrained Qwen model weights, taxonomies, source-platform data, and external datasets are not claimed as owned by ResumeIntel. The repository currently has no selected software license; dependency notices and dataset rights require separate review.\par}{\pard\fs24\sa140\sl276\slmult1 The claimed contribution is the authored source-code expression and its particular integration, user interface, data schemas, rule configuration, and workflows as evidenced in this repository. Do not assert \u8220?first\u8221?, \u8220?unique in the market\u8221?, or validated superiority without comparative research.\par}{\pard\fs26\b\sb360\sa160 4. Authorship and ownership facts to complete\par}{\pard\fi-360\li720\fs24\sa120\sl276\slmult1 \bullet\tab Identify all authors/contributors and their contribution periods from version-control and institutional records.\par}{\pard\fi-360\li720\fs24\sa120\sl276\slmult1 \bullet\tab Confirm whether applicant is the student, institution, or another rights holder; obtain mentor/institution guidance and any required consent/NOC.\par}{\pard\fi-360\li720\fs24\sa120\sl276\slmult1 \bullet\tab Review third-party dependency licenses and model/data terms before distribution or filing.\par}{\pard\fi-360\li720\fs24\sa120\sl276\slmult1 \bullet\tab Prepare the source-code PDF and object-code deliverable according to current portal instructions; do not redact portions where the portal prohibits redaction.\par}{\pard\fi-360\li720\fs24\sa120\sl276\slmult1 \bullet\tab Share portal credentials only through a separate institution-approved secure method; never add them to this package.\par}{\pard\fs26\b\sb360\sa160 5. Official references\par}{\pard\fs24\sa140\sl276\slmult1 Government of India Copyright Office FAQ: https://copyright.gov.in/frmFAQ.aspx\par}{\pard\fs24\sa140\sl276\slmult1 Copyright Rules, 2013, Chapter XIII, Rule 70(5): https://copyright.gov.in/Copyright_Rules_2013/chapter_xiii.html\par}{\pard\fs24\sa140\sl276\slmult1 Copyright Office online filing instructions: https://copyright.gov.in/UserRegistration/BOLoginPage.aspx\par}{\pard\fs19\sa100 Web pages checked 13 November 2026. Requirements can change; verify at filing time.\par}}